       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-TF-GRAPH-PARTITIONING.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-PARTITION-PARALLELISM-PROOFS.
           05  WS-PIPELINE-1F1B-DEADLOCK-OK PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TENSOR-PARALLEL-MEGATRON  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-ZERO-STAGE3-OFFLOAD-OK    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-INTEROP-SENDRECV-PAIRS-OK PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-SHARDED-VARIABLE-ZMM-OK   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-PARTITION-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-PARTITIONS-PROVEN     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-PARTITION-CODE      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-PIPELINE-AND-TENSOR-PARALLEL.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-ZERO-STAGE3-AND-PAIRS.
           PERFORM 3000-EVALUATE-SHARDED-VARIABLES.
           PERFORM 4000-SYNTHESIZE-PARTITIONING.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-PIPELINE-AND-TENSOR-PARALLEL.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-PIPELINE-1F1B-DEADLOCK-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-TENSOR-PARALLEL-MEGATRON.
       2000-EVALUATE-ZERO-STAGE3-AND-PAIRS.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-ZERO-STAGE3-OFFLOAD-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-INTEROP-SENDRECV-PAIRS-OK.
       3000-EVALUATE-SHARDED-VARIABLES.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-SHARDED-VARIABLE-ZMM-OK.
       4000-SYNTHESIZE-PARTITIONING.
           IF WS-PIPELINE-1F1B-DEADLOCK-OK = 1 AND
              WS-TENSOR-PARALLEL-MEGATRON = 1 AND
              WS-ZERO-STAGE3-OFFLOAD-OK = 1 AND
              WS-INTEROP-SENDRECV-PAIRS-OK = 1 AND
              WS-SHARDED-VARIABLE-ZMM-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-PARTITIONS-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-PARTITION-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-PARTITIONS-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-PARTITION-CODE.
